ENGLISH TRANSLATION, TYPESETTING, AND EDITORIAL APPARATUS
=======================================================

To the extent that the project holds rights in the English translation,
modern TeX typesetting, project-authored metadata, indexes, decision records,
and QA evidence in this repository, those materials are licensed under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Project contribution: "AI typesetting & translation."

UNDERLYING WORK AND SOURCE EDITION
==================================

The underlying mathematical work is by Alexandre Grothendieck and Jean
Dieudonné. The historical French edition, inherited English witnesses, and
third-party bibliographic material retain their own rights and attribution.
This file does not purport to relicense rights that the project does not hold.
Preserve the French NUMDAM authority, author attribution, provenance, and
non-endorsement caveats.

COMMUNITY ENGLISH TRANSLATION
=============================

Retained English text and TeX derive in part from the ryankeleti/ega community
translation: https://github.com/ryankeleti/ega . Its named contributors include
Mateo Carmona, Tim Holzschuh, Tim Hosgood, Ryan Keleti, Thiago Solovera & Nery,
and Wayne Yang. See ATTRIBUTION.md for the source version and contribution scope.
The limited grant above does not license or relicense their contributions.
